# Build contexts are the repo root (.docker/*/Dockerfile*, Dockerfile.dev).
# These never belong in an image; keeping them out also keeps context upload
# small. Nothing the Dockerfiles COPY is excluded here.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env*
**/*.md
server/data
.git
**/.DS_Store
.zcode/
